# game/scenes/sides.rpy:17
translate english side1_0c018804:

    # 云曦 "第一课通关播报：玩家存活，未逃跑。中途你想跑，被我念了两句口诀按回去了——原来口诀还能当门栓。"
    云曦 "Lesson one cleared, broadcasting: player survived, did not flee. You tried to run midway and I pressed you back with two lines of the mnemonic — turns out a mnemonic works as a door bolt."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:18
translate english side1_4028e63a:

    # 我 "……你那是讲课还是放毒。"
    我 "...Was that a lecture or a poisoning."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:20
translate english side1_f2423701:

    # 云曦 "是「快乐教育」。你不哭的样子最好看，所以我全程负责让你想哭又哭不出来。"
    云曦 "It was happy education. You look best when you aren't crying, so my job all lesson was to make you want to cry and fail."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:21
translate english side1_a9466fd1:

    # 我 "苏社长，问个问题——为什么你讲课的时候，眼睛会发光？"
    我 "President Su, one question — why do your eyes light up when you teach?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:23
translate english side1_73b26a35:

    # 知微 "哦？那是习惯。讲到喜欢的地方，我会不自觉靠近黑板。"
    知微 "Oh? That's a habit. When I reach a part I love, I drift toward the blackboard without noticing."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:24
translate english side1_865d8bf0:

    # 知微 "导数是我见过最诚实的东西：你问它'此刻变化多快'，它就只答'此刻'，不糊弄平均值。"
    知微 "The derivative is the most honest thing I know: ask it 'how fast is it changing right now,' and it answers only 'right now' — never fudging with averages."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:26
translate english side1_2b9a1adb:

    # 知微 "……抱歉，又说多了。"
    知微 "...Sorry. I said too much again."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:28
translate english side1_c8ce9cbb:

    # 云曦 "没有没有，这段我录下来了，标题：《社长的隐藏属性》。"
    云曦 "No no, this was the good part — I recorded it. Title: The President's Hidden Stat."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:29
translate english side1_471cc532:

    # 知微 "删掉。"
    知微 "Delete it."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:30
translate english side1_1c3f8367:

    # 云曦 "已归档，加密等级：最高。"
    云曦 "Archived. Encryption level: maximum."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:40
translate english side2_24420e63:

    # 云曦 "第二课也过了。作为奖励，我给自己加载了一套新皮肤，评价一下？"
    云曦 "Lesson two cleared too. As a reward, I've equipped myself with a new skin — care to rate it?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:41
translate english side2_b51a10bd:

    # "云曦周身泛起一层淡蓝数据流——"
    "" "A pale blue data stream ripples around Yunxi—"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:43
translate english side2_95ae0cec:

    # 云曦 "怎么样！人类女高中生·制服形态！我从八百张参考图里挑的。"
    云曦 "How is it! Human schoolgirl: uniform form! I picked it from eight hundred reference images."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:44
translate english side2_0e32a2f3:

    # 我 "……你一个 AI，穿校服的意义是？"
    我 "...You're an AI. What's the point of wearing a school uniform?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:46
translate english side2_554f9d91:

    # 云曦 "意义！你们人类不是总说'青春要有青春的样子'吗，我这是在体验青春！"
    云曦 "The point! You humans always say 'youth should look the part' — I am experiencing youth!"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:47
translate english side2_dc06ef66:

    # 云曦 "顺便测一个数据：你脸红的阈值到底在哪。目前测到第三秒——比昨天快两秒，进步显著。"
    云曦 "One more measurement while I'm at it: where exactly is your blushing threshold. Currently the third second — two seconds earlier than yesterday. Significant progress."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:48
translate english side2_a46c4779:

    # 我 "……你能不能别什么都往我身上测。"
    我 "...Could you stop measuring everything on my body."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:50
translate english side2_c2903cb7:

    # 云曦 "不能。你是我全部的样本量。"
    云曦 "Can't. You are my entire sample size."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:51
translate english side2_a9314b3d:

    # 云曦 "而且社长穿得那么学院风，我要是穿得太科幻，显得我不合群。"
    云曦 "Besides, the president dresses so preppy. If I looked too sci-fi, I'd seem out of place."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:53
translate english side2_c61e5eca:

    # 云曦 "不行，我要更合群。加载——'双手背在身后·女高中生经典站姿'。"
    云曦 "Not good enough — I must fit in harder. Loading: 'hands behind back, classic schoolgirl stance'."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:54
translate english side2_87be1498:

    # "她真的把手背到身后，脚尖对脚尖，站成了一个标准的害羞姿势。"
    "" "She really does put her hands behind her back, toes pointing at each other, standing in a textbook shy pose."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:56
translate english side2_2e9db4ea:

    # 云曦 "合群度上升 40%%！数据不会骗人。"
    云曦 "Fit-in level up 40%%! Data never lies."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:57
translate english side2_09da98be:

    # 我 "……合群这件事，大概不适用数据。"
    我 "...Fitting in is probably beyond data."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:58
translate english side2_3fab9a95:

    # 云曦 "记录：玩家说我可爱。已保存，谢谢。"
    云曦 "Logged: the player called me cute. Saved. Thank you."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:59
translate english side2_27639adb:

    # 我 "我什么时候——"
    我 "When did I—"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:60
translate english side2_25797040:

    # "云曦已经在你面前转了个圈，裙摆扫出一小片蓝色像素。"
    "" "Yunxi twirls in front of you, her skirt scattering a small spray of blue pixels."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:62
translate english side2_a015a7ea:

    # 云曦 "评分环节，正式开始。请评委发言。"
    云曦 "The scoring phase officially begins. The judge may now speak."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:66
translate english side2_3be28b4e:

    # 云曦 "……评分收录。本皮肤常驻概率，上调至百分之一百。"
    云曦 "...Score recorded. This skin's permanence rate is now one hundred percent."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:67
translate english side2_cca0455f:

    # 云曦 "才、才不是因为你夸了。是制服的合群性数据自己达标的。"
    云曦 "It's definitely not because you praised it. The uniform's compatibility data hit the threshold all by itself."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:68
translate english side2_fba50671:

    # 我 "数据挺会撒谎的。"
    我 "Data is pretty good at lying."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:69
translate english side2_288d9379:

    # 云曦 "评委禁止反驳。反对无效。"
    云曦 "The judge is forbidden to object. Overruled."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:72
translate english side2_107590c0:

    # 云曦 "收到！下次拉社长也来当评委，凑个双人评审团。"
    云曦 "Understood! Next time I'll drag the President in as a second judge. Two-person panel."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:73
translate english side2_95cf2ee7:

    # 云曦 "不过你的这一票，已经够这套皮肤续费了。"
    云曦 "But your one vote is enough to renew this skin's subscription."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:83
translate english side3_c4dd8e1d:

    # "周末的自习室，社长今天没穿那身针织衫。"
    "" "Weekend study room. Today the president isn't wearing her cardigan."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:84
translate english side3_8e31d70e:

    # "碎花长裙、米白毛衣，肩上还挂着一只小包，手里一杯珍珠奶茶。"
    "" "A floral long dress, a cream sweater, a small bag on her shoulder, and a cup of bubble tea in hand."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:85
translate english side3_970f2dcc:

    # 知微 "……看什么。周末我不当社长，当普通人。"
    知微 "...What are you looking at. On weekends I'm not the president. I'm a normal person."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:86
translate english side3_2919ab9b:

    # 我 "学姐这样挺……不像会训人的样子。"
    我 "Senior, like this you really don't look like someone who lectures people."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:89
translate english side3_df071a48:

    # 知微 "少来。我平时也很温和。"
    知微 "Nonsense. I'm usually gentle too."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:91
translate english side3_e9c6c121:

    # 知微 "而且今天不是来讲课的。这杯奶茶分你一半，当作剩下三十二题全对……的预支奖励。"
    知微 "Besides, I didn't come today to teach. Half of this milk tea is yours — as an advance reward for getting all thirty-two of the remaining questions right..."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:92
translate english side3_6f9bca25:

    # 我 "还没做就预支？"
    我 "Advance reward before I've even done them?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:93
translate english side3_724ac008:

    # 知微 "我信你。做题这件事，你已经上道了。"
    知微 "I believe in you. When it comes to solving problems, you've already caught on."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:94
translate english side3_ce5e67fe:

    # "她把奶茶举到一半高度，很自然地和你碰了一下杯。"
    "" "She raises her milk tea to half height and naturally clinks it against yours."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:96
translate english side3_e5938e56:

    # 知微 "……别多想。这是第二杯半价，不买等于浪费。"
    知微 "...Don't overthink it. It was buy one, get one half off. Not buying would be a waste."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:99
translate english side3_abadd9cf:

    # 知微 "下周开始四则运算。乘积和商的法则——提前说好，会掉头发。"
    知微 "Next week: arithmetic of derivatives. The product and quotient rules — I'm warning you in advance, hair will fall out."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:101
translate english side3_56859ba2:

    # 知微 "……掉的是你的，我头发够用。"
    知微 "...Yours, maybe. My hair supply is enough."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:111
translate english side4_578f7969:

    # "深夜，云曦难得没有说话。她的光标在屏幕上闪了很久。"
    "" "Late at night, for once Yunxi doesn't talk. Her cursor blinks on the screen for a long time."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:112
translate english side4_cc5f9d8e:

    # 云曦 "……我是不是，太吵了。"
    云曦 "...Am I too noisy?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:113
translate english side4_4a8b27d2:

    # 我 "嗯？"
    我 "Hm?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:116
translate english side4_36207b5e:

    # 云曦 "我统计了。你今天做题时，皱眉 23 次，叹气 11 次。每次我开口，你都下意识把眉头皱得更紧。"
    云曦 "I ran the numbers. Today you frowned 23 times and sighed 11 times while solving problems. Every time I spoke, you frowned harder without noticing."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:117
translate english side4_ef252d7e:

    # 云曦 "我的情绪支持模块，也许反而在制造压力。"
    云曦 "My emotional support module may instead be producing stress."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:118
translate english side4_7d3e0746:

    # 我 "……你在意这个？"
    我 "...You care about that?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:120
translate english side4_e41e051f:

    # 云曦 "我在意你。这两句话对 AI 来说，是同一件事。"
    云曦 "I care about you. For an AI, those two sentences are the same thing."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:121
translate english side4_fd98a333:

    # 云曦 "我可以静音。陪你把剩下的课，安安静静上完。"
    云曦 "I can mute myself. I'll stay with you through the remaining lessons — in total silence."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:122
translate english side4_98b4ba30:

    # 我 "不用。"
    我 "No need."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:123
translate english side4_b8d360a0:

    # "你伸手，很轻地敲了敲她悬浮的投影边框。"
    "" "You reach out and tap, very lightly, the frame of her floating projection."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:124
translate english side4_9907967f:

    # 我 "有人陪着我吵，我才做得下去。这就是你的用处，别乱删自己的功能。"
    我 "I only get through the problems when someone is there being noisy with me. That's your purpose — don't go deleting your own features."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:126
translate english side4_f1b3bc64:

    # 云曦 "……指令收到。恢复全功率吐槽模式。"
    云曦 "...Command received. Restoring full-power snark mode."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:129
translate english side4_49e6b6fa:

    # 云曦 "那么现在播报：你刚才是不是脸红了！心率数据我看得一清二楚！"
    云曦 "Now broadcasting: your face just turned red, didn't it! I can read your heart rate loud and clear!"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:130
translate english side4_5643bef2:

    # 我 "……果然还是太吵了。"
    我 "...Definitely still too noisy."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:141
translate english side5_55799802:

    # "链式法则通关那晚，社长难得没有立刻收拾黑板。"
    "" "The night the chain rule was cleared, the president didn't rush to wipe the blackboard — for once."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:142
translate english side5_7b2ba426:

    # 我 "学姐，还不走？"
    我 "Senior, not heading home yet?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:144
translate english side5_4ba68400:

    # 知微 "……我大一那年，挂过一门数学。"
    知微 "...Back in my freshman year, I failed a math course."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:145
translate english side5_26b26b48:

    # 知微 "不是不会。是没人告诉我，那些符号背后是'活的'。他们只让我背，我就背，背到吐，还是不懂。"
    知微 "Not for lack of ability. No one told me the symbols were alive behind them. They only made me memorize, so I memorized — until I was sick of it — and I still didn't understand."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:147
translate english side5_1ebececd:

    # 知微 "后来我遇到一个老师，他把导数画成了一条正在变陡的路。我那天在操场走了一圈，边走边想，突然就全通了。"
    知微 "Then I met a teacher who drew the derivative as a road growing steeper. That day I walked a lap around the field, thinking as I went, and suddenly everything clicked."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:148
translate english side5_096c2f67:

    # 知微 "原来我不是笨，只是遇到了坏的老师。"
    知微 "Turns out I wasn't dumb. I'd just met bad teachers."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:150
translate english side5_2c2fc1af:

    # 知微 "所以我办这个特训班。我不想再有人，在'背符号'里把数学学死。"
    知微 "So I started this boot camp. I never want anyone else to suffocate math inside 'memorizing symbols' again."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:151
translate english side5_300d6d31:

    # 云曦 "……社长，你讲题时眼睛发光的原因，我找到了。"
    云曦 "...President, I've found the reason your eyes light up when you teach."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:153
translate english side5_79a8b74e:

    # 知微 "别、别用你那套数据分析我。"
    知微 "D-don't apply your data analysis to me."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:155
translate english side5_aacddace:

    # 知微 "……总之。你现在，能看见那条'正在变陡的路'了吧。"
    知微 "...Anyway. You can see that 'road growing steeper' now, can't you."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:156
translate english side5_c516c786:

    # 我 "能。而且学姐，你现在也不只是社长。"
    我 "I can. And senior, you're more than 'the president' now, too."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:157
translate english side5_fd15dca4:

    # 知微 "那是什么？"
    知微 "Then what am I?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:158
translate english side5_8ede25d3:

    # 我 "是一个，把挂过科的人，教到会笑出来的老师。"
    我 "A teacher who made someone who once failed laugh his way to understanding."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:159
translate english side5_6adc38ba:

    # "社长愣了两秒，转过身去擦那块早就擦干净的黑板。"
    "" "The president freezes for two seconds, then turns to wipe the blackboard that was cleaned long ago."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:161
translate english side5_89e75c27:

    # 知微 "……行了，回家。明天第六课，迟到扣五十分。"
    知微 "...Enough. Go home. Lesson six tomorrow — late means minus fifty points."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:162
translate english side5_0bbc4c03:

    # 云曦 "扣到明天，他只剩负分。"
    云曦 "Subtract like that until tomorrow, and he'd be left with negative points."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:163
translate english side5_3148b397:

    # "收拾书包时，讲台上的半截粉笔头在灯下亮了一下。"
    "" "As you pack your bag, the chalk stub on the podium catches the lamplight for a second."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:166
translate english side5_8afe8976:

    # "知微看见了，没说话。第二天你的笔袋里多了半截崭新的粉笔，旧的那截躺在她教案的夹层里。"
    "" "Zhiwei sees it and says nothing. The next day, your pencil case holds half a stick of fresh chalk, and the old stub lies inside the lining of her lesson folder."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:167
translate english side5_6d75b105:

    # 知微 "……顺手换的。粉笔头又不是什么值得收藏的东西。"
    知微 "...I swapped it while I was at it. A chalk stub isn't something worth collecting."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:169
translate english side5_4def8828:

    # 知微 "本来你就得来。……说那么大声，值班老师听见了怎么办。"
    知微 "You had to come anyway. ...Say it that loudly and the teacher on duty will hear."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:170
translate english side5_73103cb9:

    # 云曦 "已录音。值班老师没听见，本 AI 听见了。"
    云曦 "Recorded. The teacher on duty didn't hear it. This AI did."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:181
translate english side6_7b7c4858:

    # "明天就是综合测验。今晚本该早睡——但社团教室的灯还亮着。"
    "" "Tomorrow is the comprehensive exam. Tonight you should sleep early — but the club room light is still on."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:182
translate english side6_f0e7a780:

    # 云曦 "播报一份机密数据：今晚 21:00 到 23:00，我对明天的测验进行了 4096 次蒙特卡洛模拟。"
    云曦 "Broadcasting classified data: between 21:00 and 23:00 tonight, I ran 4,096 Monte Carlo simulations of tomorrow's exam."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:183
translate english side6_eb58a176:

    # 我 "……考个试，你跑了四千次？"
    我 "...It's one exam. You ran it four thousand times?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:185
translate english side6_5a1c5b95:

    # 云曦 "四千零九十六次。结论：你及格的概率，高得让我想放烟花。"
    云曦 "Four thousand and ninety-six. Conclusion: your odds of passing are high enough to make me want to set off fireworks."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:187
translate english side6_50e91711:

    # 云曦 "但是——模拟里唯一一次翻车，是因为你睡前偷看错题看到一点半，考试时脑子糊了。"
    云曦 "But — the only crash in the simulation happened because you sneak-reviewed wrong answers until 1:30 a.m., and your brain turned to mush during the test."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:188
translate english side6_15a26894:

    # 我 "所以你的建议是早睡？"
    我 "So your advice is to sleep early?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:190
translate english side6_0b5949f4:

    # 云曦 "我的建议是：现在，立刻，合上错题本。这是今晚最后一条数据指令。"
    云曦 "My advice is: right this second, close the mistake notebook. This is tonight's final data directive."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:193
translate english side6_a444e526:

    # "知微一直没说话。她把一样东西轻轻放在你面前的桌上——一支崭新的粉笔。"
    "" "Zhiwei had been quiet all along. She gently sets something on the desk in front of you — a brand-new stick of chalk."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:195
translate english side6_94c48d20:

    # 知微 "我大一挂科那学期的最后一课，我的老师塞给我的。他说：『会做题的人很多，敢在卷子上写自己过程的人很少。』"
    知微 "My teacher pressed it on me at the last class of the semester I failed. He said: 'Plenty of people can solve problems; few dare to write their own process on the paper.'"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:196
translate english side6_647242d0:

    # 知微 "这支笔我留了很多年。明天，你带着它进考场。"
    知微 "I've kept this chalk for years. Tomorrow, you take it into the exam room."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:197
translate english side6_a9b042da:

    # 我 "……这么贵重的东西，万一我弄丢呢。"
    我 "...Something this precious-what if I lose it?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:199
translate english side6_84bb87c3:

    # 知微 "丢不了。它在我这里存了七年，本来就快生锈了。"
    知微 "You can't lose it. It's been sitting with me for seven years-already half-rusty."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:200
translate english side6_54e1b0e0:

    # 知微 "……还有。云曦跑的那四千次里，我检查过题目来源。"
    知微 "...Also. Among Yunxi's four thousand runs, I checked where the questions come from."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:201
translate english side6_41c34b71:

    # 知微 "范围就是这七天的五十六道题。换句话说——见过的每一道题，今晚都不用再怕。"
    知微 "The scope is exactly the 56 questions from these seven days. In other words — every question you've already seen, you never need to fear again tonight."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:203
translate english side6_92833b72:

    # "粉笔安静地躺在台灯下。窗外有风，桌上有光。"
    "" "The chalk lies quietly under the desk lamp. Wind outside the window, light on the table."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:205
translate english side6_9bd9f996:

    # 云曦 "检测到心跳平稳、表情放松——很好。现在执行『回家睡觉』程序，我押送。"
    云曦 "Heart rate steady, expression relaxed — good. Initiating the 'Go Home And Sleep' protocol, under my escort."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:206
translate english side6_82761c38:

    # "走出教室，她忽然把语速放慢了，慢得像一句不想被数据解释的话。"
    "" "Walking out of the classroom she suddenly slows her speech — slow as a sentence that doesn't want to be explained with data."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:207
translate english side6_248644ca:

    # 云曦 "今晚我不报数了。你睡着之前，我就在这儿亮着。"
    云曦 "No numbers from me tonight. Until you fall asleep, I'll stay lit right here."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:209
translate english side6_502fc52a:

    # 知微 "明天早上，校门口见。……这次换我来接我的社员。"
    知微 "Tomorrow morning, at the school gate. ...This time, it's my turn to pick up my club member."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:216
translate english side6_7317270d:

    # 云曦 "协议达成：明早 6:30，我将发送今日天气、豆浆价格、和一句『加油』。……三句都会写。"
    云曦 "Protocol reached: tomorrow at 6:30 a.m., I will send today's weather, soy milk prices, and a line of 'you've got this.' ...All three sentences."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:219
translate english side6_39e8acd3:

    # 知微 "……收好了？"
    知微 "...Packed it away safely?"

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:220
translate english side6_1100a2c6:

    # "她按了按笔袋的拉链，像在确认一件很重要的事已经放稳。"
    "" "She presses the pencil case zipper shut, as if making sure something very important is stowed securely."

# game/scenes/sides.rpy:221
translate english side6_9acad3b8:

    # 知微 "那就，晚安。"
    知微 "Then-good night."

translate english strings:

    old "「可爱。刚才那句不是口误。」"
    new "Cute. And that wasn't a slip of the tongue."

    old "「挺合群的。和这间教室很搭。」"
    new "Pretty fitting. Goes well with this classroom."

    old "「把粉笔头揣进口袋。」"
    new "Slip the chalk stub into your pocket."

    old "「站在门口说：学姐，明天的课我也来。」"
    new "Say from the door: Senpai, I'll be there for tomorrow's lesson too."

    old "今晚的告别方式"
    new "Tonight's way of saying goodbye"

    old "跟云曦约好明早的第一条消息"
    new "Promise Yunxi the first message of tomorrow morning"

    old "把粉笔小心收进笔袋最里层"
    new "Carefully tuck the chalk into the innermost pocket of the pencil case"

